<div id="app" class="home-page">
  <section class="atelier-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="atelier-hero__copy">
      <p class="atelier-hero__note">為重要時刻選一束花</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">讓花成為<br>最安靜的奢華。</h1>
      <p class="atelier-hero__lead">以季節花材與精準比例，為每一個值得留下的時刻，完成獨一無二的花藝作品。</p>
      <div class="atelier-hero__actions">
        <a href="#products" class="button-primary">瀏覽本季作品</a>
        <span>台北市區專人配送</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="atelier-hero__visual">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1764269722555-d14c6cbb7944?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1400" alt="本季精選花藝作品">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="products" class="catalog-section content-shell" aria-labelledby="catalog-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p>本季花藝作品</p>
        <h2 id="catalog-title">選一份恰到好處的心意</h2>
      </div>
      <span>每件作品均含精品包裝，可於結帳時留下贈禮需求。</span>
    </div>

    <div v-if="loading" class="flex justify-center py-12" aria-label="載入中">
      <div class="w-8 h-8 border-4 border-rose-primary border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin"></div>
    </div>

    <template v-else>
      <div v-if="products.length === 0" class="empty-state text-center py-12">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-3">✿</div>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">今日花材正在整理中</p>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">請稍後再回來看看</p>
      </div>

      <div v-else class="catalog-grid">
        <article
          v-for="product in products"
          :key="product.id"
          class="catalog-card"
          tabindex="0"
          @click="goToProduct(product.id)"
          @keyup.enter="goToProduct(product.id)"
        >
          <div class="catalog-card__image">
            <img :src="product.image_url || 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1490750967868-88aa4f44baee?w=700'" :alt="product.name">
          </div>
          <div class="catalog-card__body">
            <div>
              <h3>{{ product.name }}</h3>
              <strong>NT$ {{ product.price.toLocaleString() }}</strong>
            </div>
            <button
              type="button"
              class="catalog-card__add"
              :disabled="product._adding || product.stock <= 0"
              @click.stop="addToCart(product)"
            >
              {{ product.stock <= 0 ? '已售完' : (product._adding ? '加入中…' : '加入購物車') }}
            </button>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <nav v-if="pagination.totalPages > 1" class="catalog-pagination" aria-label="商品分頁">
        <button
          v-for="pageNumber in pagination.totalPages"
          :key="pageNumber"
          type="button"
          :class="{ 'is-current': pageNumber === pagination.page }"
          :aria-current="pageNumber === pagination.page ? 'page' : null"
          @click="loadProducts(pageNumber)"
        >
          {{ pageNumber }}
        </button>
      </nav>
    </template>
  </section>

  <section class="studio-story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
    <div class="studio-story__inner content-shell">
      <div class="studio-story__image">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558362003-bc494a7fc4c4?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1200" alt="花藝師在工作桌前整理花材">
      </div>
      <div class="studio-story__copy">
        <h2 id="story-title">一束花，應該記得<br>它為誰而來。</h2>
        <p>我們依照當日花況、贈禮對象與空間氣質完成每一次訂製，不複製相同的花束。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
